  "content": "<p>“Goodbye Windows, welcome Linux”<br />Linux Installation Workshop</p><p>To mark Digital Independence Day (DI-Day), Computertruhe Munich is hosting a hands-on workshop where volunteers help you install Linux Mint on your laptop.</p><p>Date: August 2, 2026<br />Time: 14:00 – 18:00<br />Location: Munich Maker Lab, Dachauer Str. 112h, 80636 Munich<br />More details:  <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://social.computertruhe.de/@muenchen\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>muenchen</span></a></span> </p><p><a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/hackerspace\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>hackerspace</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/makerspace\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>makerspace</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/openworkshop\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>openworkshop</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MunichMakerLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MunichMakerLab</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MuMaLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MuMaLab</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/Kreativquartier\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Kreativquartier</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/Kreativlabor\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Kreativlabor</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/DIYMunich\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>DIYMunich</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/linux\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>linux</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/digitalindependence\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>digitalindependence</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/foss\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>foss</span></a></p>",
